{"title":"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the given, we have the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Equation\" title=\"Equation\">equations</a>\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/6/5f60887b227441d3862d1ee98b0432c25813ec90.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3g = 6b \\Longrightarrow g = 2b\\]\" width=\"149\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d55865cdf8b228c22e55ade16923f969057740e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2y = 5b \\Longrightarrow y = \\frac{5}{2}b\\]\" width=\"153\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/f/4af0d778d88d87a3a12b1c1fb704cc0c78650992.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4w = 6b \\Longrightarrow w = \\frac{3}{2}b\\]\" width=\"161\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Substuting gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/5/bd585625f00062f887cef31d1b231f12ad4dec64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4g + 2y + 2w = 4(2b) + 2\\left(\\frac{5}{2}b\\right) + 2\\left(\\frac{3}{2}b\\right) = 16b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"381\" height=\"43\" />, and our answer is 16.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC\" title=\"2005 PMWC\">2005 PMWC </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I13\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I13\">Problem I13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I15\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I15\">Problem I15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">I: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I1\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I2\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I3\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I4\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I5\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I6\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I7\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I8\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I9\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I10\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I11\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I11\">11</